<title>THAILAND: Krungthai Thanakit up on bank licence guarantee.</title>
<headline>Krungthai Thanakit up on bank licence guarantee.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Thai broker Krungthai Thanakit Plc rose sharply in early trade on Monday after the government pledged to give the firm a bank licence for its role in helping the ailing finance sector, analysts said.</p>
<p>The stock had gained 1.25 baht to 15.25 by 0434 GMT in heavy volumes.</p>
</text>
